                    <div class="text-center"><div class="bg-muted rounded-full p-4 w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 flex items-center justify-center"><svg class="w-8 h-8 text-cleaning-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></div><p class="font-semibold text-foreground text-sm">Schmutz- & Kalkentfernung</p></div>
